56	 * `ZimmProductCardVariationFields` (see that file's comment in full): every variant-specific
57	 * field is optional here purely so the render body below can destructure once with no
58	 * `if`/`switch` on `props.variant`. The exported discriminated union above is what actually
59	 * enforces correct usage at every call site — this cast only relaxes internal access inside this
60	 * file; it changes nothing about what a caller may legally pass in.
61	 */
62	type ZimmCountryLanguageMismatchVariationFields = Partial<
63	  Omit<ZimmCountryLanguageMismatchLocationProps, keyof ZimmCountryLanguageMismatchBaseProps | 'variant' | 'target'> &
64	    Omit<ZimmCountryLanguageMismatchLanguageProps, keyof ZimmCountryLanguageMismatchBaseProps | 'variant' | 'target'>
65	>;
